# Generated outputs
output/
# generated by experimentell/hex3d_algohex/tet_prep.py
data/T1_9/T1_9_tet.vtk
# 588 MB of generated input geometries -- too big to version. The DESIGN
# PARAMETERS are the exception: 27 KB for all 21 candidates, and they are the
# actual input, carried in every exported sample's `params` field. Without them
# a third party cannot check what a sample claims to be. The 22 MB mesh.msh
# each of them generates stays out.
#
# Written as a descent chain, not as `data/random_tistos/` plus a negation:
# git never looks inside an excluded DIRECTORY, so a `!` on a file below it
# has no effect. Each level must exclude contents while still being entered.
data/random_tistos/*
!data/random_tistos/investigated/
data/random_tistos/investigated/*
!data/random_tistos/investigated/*/
data/random_tistos/investigated/*/*
!data/random_tistos/investigated/*/params.json
graphify-out/
html_files/
.omo/
.opencode/

